@page "/"
<PageTitle>BidWinAI - Dashboard</PageTitle>

<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto p-6 mt-6">

    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-indigo-950 to-blue-900 text-white p-8 md:p-12 shadow-lg mb-10">
        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl">
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4 leading-tight">
                L'Intelligenza Artificiale al servizio dei tuoi bandi
            </h1>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-base md:text-lg mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                Ottimizza la gestione delle gare d'appalto. Carica i tuoi capitolati in PDF, monitora l'analisi del
                motore IA in tempo reale ed estrai i requisiti chiave in pochi istanti.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap">
                <a href="carica-bando"
                   class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-200 no-underline text-sm">
                    <span>Carica un nuovo bando</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-amber-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z" /></svg>
        <span>Accesso Rapido alle Funzionalità</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

        <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between group">
            <div>
                <div class="mb-4 p-3 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-lg inline-block">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4" /><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8" /><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition">Carica File PDF</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Trascina o seleziona i file dei bandi. Il sistema li salverà su disco e su PostgreSQL mettendoli in coda.
                </p>
            </div>
            <a href="carica-bando" class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 transition flex items-center gap-1 no-underline mt-2">
                Vai al caricamento →
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between group">
            <div>
                <div class="mb-4 p-3 bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 rounded-lg inline-block">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-archive" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                        <path d="M0 2a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2a1 1 0 0 1-1 1v7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5 2.5h-9A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1 12.5V5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1zm2 3v7.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 3.5 14h9a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5-1.5V5zm13-3H1v2h14zM5 7.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h5a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2 group-hover:text-amber-600 transition">Archivio Bandi</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Controlla lo stato di avanzamento dei documenti e accedi velocemente ai PDF originali salvati.
                </p>
            </div>
            <a href="carica-bando" class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-700 transition flex items-center gap-1 no-underline mt-2">
                Esplora i bandi →
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between group">
            <div>
                <div class="mb-4 p-3 bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-600 rounded-lg inline-block">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-robot" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                        <path d="M6 12.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5M3 8.062C3 6.76 4.235 5.765 5.53 5.886a26.6 26.6 0 0 0 4.94 0C11.765 5.765 13 6.76 13 8.062v1.157a.93.93 0 0 1-.765.935c-.845.147-2.34.346-4.235.346s-3.39-.2-4.235-.346A.93.93 0 0 1 3 9.219zm4.542-.827a.25.25 0 0 0-.217.068l-.92.9a25 25 0 0 1-1.871-.183.25.25 0 0 0-.068.495c.55.076 1.232.149 2.02.193a.25.25 0 0 0 .189-.071l.754-.736.847 1.71a.25.25 0 0 0 .404.062l.932-.97a25 25 0 0 0 1.922-.188.25.25 0 0 0-.068-.495c-.538.074-1.207.145-1.98.189a.25.25 0 0 0-.166.076l-.754.785-.842-1.7a.25.25 0 0 0-.182-.135" />
                        <path d="M8.5 1.866a1 1 0 1 0-1 0V3h-2A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 1 7.5V8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V9a1 1 0 0 0-1-1v-.5A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 10.5 3h-2zM14 7.5V13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 5.5 4h5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 14 7.5" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2 group-hover:text-cyan-600 transition">Analisi IA</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                    Visualizza i report generati dall'algoritmo con l'estrazione automatica di scadenze, requisiti e criticità.
                </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 px-2 py-1 rounded-md self-start mt-2 flex items-center gap-1">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span> Motore Integrato
            </span>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>